  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Cut the German sausage into 1-inch pieces and thread onto skewers.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together lime juice, dashi extract, coconut oil, salt, black pepper, garlic powder, and onion powder.",
    "Brush the mixture onto the sausage skewers.",
    "Place the skewers on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Roast in the preheated oven for 15 minutes.",
    "Serve hot in a bento box."
